Description: Vulkan-based D3D8/9/10/11 for Wine (ARM64EC)
 DXVK provides Vulkan-based implementations of DXGI and the D3D8,
 D3D9, D3D10 and D3D11 APIs for wine, built here as aarch64 (ARM64EC)
 and i386 Windows DLLs for use with the ARM64EC wine build.
 .
 The DLLs are registered through update-alternatives against wine's
 builtin implementations with priority 20 (5 when Vulkan is not
 usable at install time); per-prefix WINEDLLOVERRIDES still apply.
